        "original_id": "56bd1999-1470-5bb5-b1bd-ea738396bd75",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vincent Landay, Spike Jonze, Charlie Kaufman\n- Films: Being John Malkovich, Where the Wild Things Are, Higglety Pigglety Pop!\n- Topics: film production, feature film debut\n\nFacts:\n- Vincent Landay is a Canadian-American film producer.\n- Being John Malkovich is a 1999 American fantasy-comedy film.\n- Being John Malkovich was directed by Spike Jonze and written by Charlie Kaufman.\n- Being John Malkovich was the feature film debut of both Spike Jonze and Charlie Kaufman.\n- Vincent Landay produced Being John Malkovich.\n- Vincent Landay also produced Where the Wild Things Are.\n- Vincent Landay also produced the 2010 Canadian short film Higglety Pigglety Pop!.",
